DTSTART:20261121T050000
DTEND:20261121T150000
DTSTAMP:20261121T180522Z
UID:91b76060779023391907730473997c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The 25th Annual Pack the Pantry Food and Funds Drive\, present
 ed by Preston's Kia\, Chrysler\, Dodge\, Jeep and Ram. Volunteers will col
 lect canned goods\, nonperishable food and monetary gifts with the goal of
  filling a 53-foot Bellavance Trucking tractor-trailer for The Salvation A
 rmy Emergency Food Shelf. Santa visits Friday evening\; the 802 Ghostbuste
 rs and 501st Legion stormtroopers appear Saturday. Every $1 given through 
 the Red Kettle helps provide $7 worth of food\, and every gift stays local
 . Collection kits and online giving at www.vtpackthepantry.com. Market 32 
 by Price Chopper\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
