 your favorite queens performing live on stage. We’ve got Myki Meeks\, Ni
 ni Coco\, Darlene Mitchell\, Juicy Love Dion\, Discord Addams\, Crystal Me
 thyd and Silky Ganache. VIP Meet & Greet add-on tickets are sold separatel
 y. To attend the M&G\, fans must also purchase a ticket to the show. There
  will be a 20-minute intermission. Check DragFans.com for tour info.\n\nSo
 urces: Vermont Public
