BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Big Brothers Big Sisters x Barbarian Stowe Fundraiser
DTSTART:20261121T073000
DTEND:20261121T210000
DTSTAMP:20261121T180522Z
UID:f8612a2b070a98ad355e9806281730@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Give an Extra Gift This Holiday Season! Take a break from holi
 day shopping and enjoy a delicious meal at Barbarian Restaurant\, 454 Moun
 tain Rd. in Stowe\, on Saturday\, November 21. Your meal can do more than 
 satisfy your appetite\, it can help give Vermont youth the gift of a carin
 g mentor! A portion of the day's sales will support Big Brothers Big Siste
 rs of NH & VT and our youth mentoring programs. At Big Brothers Big Sister
 s\, we believe every young person deserves someone in their corner\, a car
 ing\, consistent mentor who listens\, encourages\, and helps them see what
 's possible. We build meaningful relationships between youth and trained v
 olunteer mentors that create lasting impact and help change lives for gene
 rations. Dine with us. Make a difference. Give the gift of mentorship!\n\n
 Sources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Barbarian Resturant\, 454 Mountain Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/big-brothe
 rs-big-sisters-x-barbarian-stowe-fundraiser-03-11-2026-16-44-26
END:VEVENT
