BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Book Signing for Inland Sea Author Sam Clark
DTSTART:20261121T130000
DTEND:20261121T150000
DTSTAMP:20261121T180522Z
UID:13d46b84d1d4504c77cc1a96532d43@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Plainfield author Sam Clark will sign copies of his new myster
 y Lock 9\, published by Onion River Press\, on Saturday\, Nov. 21\, from 1
 –3 p.m. at Bear Pond Books in Stowe. The sequel to The Inland Sea\, the 
 novel follows a retired Vermont State Police detective through a case of m
 istaken identity spanning Lake Champlain\, the Champlain Canal and the Hud
 son River. A longtime builder\, designer and cabinetmaker\, Clark draws on
  decades of exploring the region’s waterways and landscapes to bring an 
 authentic sense of place to his fiction. Bear Pond Books Stowe Bear Pond B
 ooks Stowe 38 Main St Stowe \, Vermont 05672 (802) 253-8236 https://stoweb
 ooks.com/ Submit An Event Find out what's happening in your neck of the wo
